DE:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Nanu!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Bist du auch mal wieder in
{{TAG:0005:0005:}} unterwegs, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Ich dachte, du wärst verschollen!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Aber du siehst gut aus!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Warst du
auf Reisen?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Oder sehr beschäftigt?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Oder gar beides?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sag schon!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Bu da ne?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}} yeniden {{TAG:0005:0005:}}'da mı?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}
Bu günü göreceğimi düşünmezdim.{{TAG:0003:0001:}}İyi
görünüyorsun.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} Seyahatte miydin?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Çalışıyor muydun?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} İkisi birden
mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} Hepsini anlatmanı istiyorum!

{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Hey, millet!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}} geri döndü!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Vuhuu!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:001D:}} Seni burada gerçekten
özledik.{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Bunca zamandır nerelerdeydin?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}}'ı ziyaret etmeyeli bir yıldan
fazla oldu.{{TAG:0003:0003:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} geri dönmene
çok sevindik.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} Eski günler gibi olacak!
